{"seq":2,"slug":"release-changelog-agents","title":"发布与变更日志 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/agent-workflows/release-changelog-agents","wordCount":810,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布与变更日志-agent\">发布与变更日志 Agent</h1><p>发布变更日志（Changelog）是工程团队最普遍的&quot;总是来不及写、写了也不好&quot;的文档。手写 changelog 要求工程师在发布前汇总多个 PR 的变更描述，这项工作枯燥、容易遗漏，且质量高度依赖 PR 描述的完整程度。</p>\n<p>AI Agent 在这个场景的优势明确：从结构化的 PR 数据、commit 历史、issue 关联中自动提取变更信息，按语义归类（新功能/修复/破坏性变更/内部重构），生成面向不同受众的发布说明。</p>\n<p>本文覆盖变更日志自动生成的数据流设计、Conventional Commits 的 AI 增强处理、以及面向用户和面向开发者的双版本发布说明生成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Conventional Commits</strong>（约定式提交）是 commit 信息的结构化规范，格式为 <code>type(scope): subject</code>（如 <code>feat(auth): add OAuth2 support</code>）。Changelog agent 依赖这一规范来分类变更，但现实中大量 commit 不遵循规范，agent 需要具备从不规范 commit 中推断语义的能力。</p>\n<p><strong>语义归类</strong>（Semantic Classification）指将多样化的代码变更按用户可感知的类别归类：Added（新功能）、Changed（行为变更）、Fixed（缺陷修复）、Removed（功能移除）、Security（安全相关）、Deprecated（废弃通知）。这是 Keep a Changelog 规范的核心。</p>\n<p><strong>双受众发布说明</strong>（Dual-Audience Release Notes）指同一个发布版本生成两份内容：面向最终用户的产品发布说明（聚焦&quot;对我有什么影响&quot;）和面向开发者的技术变更日志（聚焦&quot;什么变了、如何迁移&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更日志生成的数据流\">变更日志生成的数据流</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TAG[创建 Release Tag] --&gt; COLLECT[收集变更数据]&#10;&#10;    COLLECT --&gt; PR_DATA[PR 列表\\n+ 描述 + 标签]&#10;    COLLECT --&gt; COMMIT_DATA[Commit 历史\\n+ 规范分析]&#10;    COLLECT --&gt; ISSUE_DATA[关联 Issue\\n+ 里程碑数据]&#10;&#10;    PR_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS[数据预处理\\n过滤内部 PR / 合并重复]&#10;    COMMIT_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS&#10;    ISSUE_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS&#10;&#10;    PREPROCESS --&gt; CLASSIFY[AI 语义归类\\nAdded / Fixed / Changed / Security / Breaking]&#10;    CLASSIFY --&gt; DRAFT[生成草稿]&#10;&#10;    DRAFT --&gt; USER_NOTES[面向用户的发布说明]&#10;    DRAFT --&gt; DEV_NOTES[面向开发者的技术变更日志]&#10;&#10;    USER_NOTES --&gt; REVIEW_GATE{人工审查}&#10;    DEV_NOTES --&gt; REVIEW_GATE&#10;    REVIEW_GATE --&gt;|批准| PUBLISH[发布到 GitHub Release / 文档站]\">flowchart TD\n    TAG[创建 Release Tag] --&gt; COLLECT[收集变更数据]\n\n    COLLECT --&gt; PR_DATA[PR 列表\\n+ 描述 + 标签]\n    COLLECT --&gt; COMMIT_DATA[Commit 历史\\n+ 规范分析]\n    COLLECT --&gt; ISSUE_DATA[关联 Issue\\n+ 里程碑数据]\n\n    PR_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS[数据预处理\\n过滤内部 PR / 合并重复]\n    COMMIT_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS\n    ISSUE_DATA --&gt; PREPROCESS\n\n    PREPROCESS --&gt; CLASSIFY[AI 语义归类\\nAdded / Fixed / Changed / Security / Breaking]\n    CLASSIFY --&gt; DRAFT[生成草稿]\n\n    DRAFT --&gt; USER_NOTES[面向用户的发布说明]\n    DRAFT --&gt; DEV_NOTES[面向开发者的技术变更日志]\n\n    USER_NOTES --&gt; REVIEW_GATE{人工审查}\n    DEV_NOTES --&gt; REVIEW_GATE\n    REVIEW_GATE --&gt;|批准| PUBLISH[发布到 GitHub Release / 文档站]</pre><h2 id=\"数据收集-从-pr-到结构化变更集\">数据收集：从 PR 到结构化变更集</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// scripts/changelog-collect.mjs&#10;async function collectReleaseDiff(fromTag, toTag, repo) {&#10;  const octokit = new Octokit({ auth: process.env.GITHUB_TOKEN });&#10;&#10;  // 获取两个 tag 之间合并的所有 PR&#10;  const { data: comparison } = await octokit.repos.compareCommits({&#10;    ...repo,&#10;    base: fromTag,&#10;    head: toTag,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const mergedPRs = await Promise.all(&#10;    comparison.commits&#10;      .filter((c) =&gt; c.commit.message.startsWith(&#39;Merge pull request&#39;))&#10;      .map(async (c) =&gt; {&#10;        const prNumber = extractPRNumber(c.commit.message);&#10;        const pr = await octokit.pulls.get({ ...repo, pull_number: prNumber });&#10;        return {&#10;          number: pr.data.number,&#10;          title: pr.data.title,&#10;          body: pr.data.body,&#10;          labels: pr.data.labels.map((l) =&gt; l.name),&#10;          author: pr.data.user.login,&#10;          merged_at: pr.data.merged_at,&#10;          linked_issues: extractLinkedIssues(pr.data.body),&#10;        };&#10;      }),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  // 过滤内部 / 基础设施 PR（不应出现在用户可见的 changelog）&#10;  return mergedPRs.filter((pr) =&gt; !pr.labels.some((l) =&gt; [&#39;internal&#39;, &#39;chore&#39;, &#39;ci&#39;, &#39;docs&#39;].includes(l)));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/changelog-collect.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> collectReleaseDiff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fromTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> octokit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Octokit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ auth: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 获取两个 tag 之间合并的所有 PR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">comparison</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> octokit.repos.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareCommits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base: fromTag,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    head: toTag,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mergedPRs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    comparison.commits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.commit.message.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Merge pull request'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractPRNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.commit.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> octokit.pulls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repo, pull_number: prNumber });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          number: pr.data.number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          title: pr.data.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          body: pr.data.body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          labels: pr.data.labels.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l.name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          author: pr.data.user.login,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          merged_at: pr.data.merged_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          linked_issues: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extractLinkedIssues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pr.data.body),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 过滤内部 / 基础设施 PR（不应出现在用户可见的 changelog）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mergedPRs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pr.labels.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'internal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ci'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(l)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ai-语义归类与-changelog-生成\">AI 语义归类与 changelog 生成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const CHANGELOG_SYSTEM_PROMPT = `You are a technical writer generating release notes.&#10;&#10;Classify each PR into one of these categories:&#10;- ADDED: New features, new APIs, new capabilities&#10;- CHANGED: Changes to existing functionality (not bug fixes)&#10;- FIXED: Bug fixes, crash fixes, error handling improvements&#10;- SECURITY: Security fixes or security-related improvements&#10;- DEPRECATED: Features being phased out with migration path&#10;- REMOVED: Removed features or APIs&#10;- BREAKING: Changes that break backward compatibility&#10;&#10;For BREAKING changes, always include a migration guide.&#10;&#10;Then generate two versions of release notes:&#10;&#10;1. USER_NOTES (non-technical, focus on user impact):&#10;   - Written for end users and product stakeholders&#10;   - Explain what changed in plain language, focusing on benefits/impact&#10;   - Skip internal refactors, CI changes, dependency bumps&#10;   &#10;2. DEV_NOTES (technical changelog):&#10;   - Written for developers integrating with or building on this software&#10;   - Include API changes, configuration changes, deprecation notices&#10;   - Include breaking change migration guides`;&#10;&#10;async function generateChangelog(prs, version) {&#10;  const prSummaries = prs.map((pr) =&gt; ({&#10;    title: pr.title,&#10;    description: pr.body?.slice(0, 500), // 截断过长描述&#10;    labels: pr.labels,&#10;    author: pr.author,&#10;  }));&#10;&#10;  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-opus-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 8192,&#10;    system: CHANGELOG_SYSTEM_PROMPT,&#10;    messages: [&#10;      {&#10;        role: &#39;user&#39;,&#10;        content: `Version: ${version}\\nPRs to include:\\n${JSON.stringify(prSummaries, null, 2)}`,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return parseChangelogResponse(response.content[0].text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CHANGELOG_SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `You are a technical writer generating release notes.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Classify each PR into one of these categories:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- ADDED: New features, new APIs, new capabilities</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- CHANGED: Changes to existing functionality (not bug fixes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- FIXED: Bug fixes, crash fixes, error handling improvements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- SECURITY: Security fixes or security-related improvements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- DEPRECATED: Features being phased out with migration path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- REMOVED: Removed features or APIs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- BREAKING: Changes that break backward compatibility</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">For BREAKING changes, always include a migration guide.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Then generate two versions of release notes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. USER_NOTES (non-technical, focus on user impact):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   - Written for end users and product stakeholders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--